.\" Man page for f (cfm)
.\" Contextual File Manager
.\"
.TH F 1 "2026-05-31" "cfm 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.\"
.SH NAME
f \- contextual file manager with instant context
.\"
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B f
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ PATH ]
.br
.B f banner
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ PATH ]
.br
.B f env
.RI [ PATH ]
.br
.B f config
.br
.B f daemon
.RI { start | stop | status }
.\"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cfm
is a directory listing tool that shows instant context about your project.
When you run
.BR f ,
you see:
.IP \(bu 2
File listing with permissions, owner, group, size, date, name
.IP \(bu 2
Git status, last commit, commits today, branches
.IP \(bu 2
Build status with duration
.IP \(bu 2
TODO count
.IP \(bu 2
Languages breakdown
.IP \(bu 2
Ports in use
.IP \(bu 2
Docker status
.IP \(bu 2
Cached test results
.PP
All instantly, no extra commands needed.
.\"
.SH OPTIONS
.SS General Options
.TP
.BR \-\-help
Display help information.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Display version information.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Enable verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-debug
Enable debug output.
.\"
.SS Banner Options
.TP
.BR \-\-raw
Output raw paths (no formatting, for piping).
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Output JSON (for scripting).
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-compact
Compact output (fewer lines).
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-hidden
Show hidden files (dotfiles).
.TP
.BR \-\-classify
Append type indicator (*/=>@|).
.TP
.BR \-\-relative\-date
Show relative dates (e.g., "2h ago", "just now").
.TP
.BI \-\-sort " MODE"
Sort order: name, size, date, type, git, extension, version.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-timesort
Sort by time modified.
.TP
.BR \-S ", " \-\-sizesort
Sort by size.
.TP
.BR \-X ", " \-\-extensionsort
Sort by file extension.
.TP
.BR \-G ", " \-\-gitsort
Sort by git status.
.TP
.BR \-\-versionsort
Natural sort (version numbers).
.TP
.BR \-U ", " \-\-no\-sort
No sort \(em list in directory order.
.TP
.BR \-\-reverse
Reverse sort order.
.TP
.BR \-\-group\-dirs \fR=\fIMODE
Group directories: none, first, last.
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-group
Group items by type (dirs, files, symlinks).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-filter \fR=\fIPATTERN
Filter items by pattern (glob or extension).
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-max \fR=\fIN
Maximum number of items to display.
.TP
.BR \-\-blocks \fR=\fICOLUMNS
Columns to display (comma-separated: permission,owner,group,size,contents,date,name).
.TP
.BR \-\-tree [\fIDEPTH\fR]
Tree view with specified depth (0 = unlimited).
.\"
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B f
Show the contextual directory dashboard.
.TP
.B f /path/to/dir
Show dashboard for a specific directory.
.TP
.B f \-\-json
Output as JSON for scripting.
.TP
.B f \-\-raw
Output raw paths for piping.
.TP
.B f \-\-classify
Show type indicators after filenames.
.TP
.B f \-\-relative\-date
Show dates as relative times.
.TP
.B f \-\-blocks name,size,git
Show only name, size, and git columns.
.TP
.B f env
Output shell aliases for current project type.
.TP
.B f config
Open configuration file in editor.
.TP
.B f daemon status
Check if daemon is running.
.\"
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration file is located at
.IR ~/.config/cfm/config.toml .
.PP
See the README for full configuration options.
.\"
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CFM_ICONS
Set to "1" to enable icons.
.TP
.B CFM_COLORS
Set to "1" to enable colors.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable colors when set.
.TP
.B CFM_NO_TODOS
Set to "1" to disable TODO counting.
.TP
.B CFM_NO_PORTS
Set to "1" to disable port detection.
.TP
.B CFM_NO_DOCKER
Set to "1" to disable Docker detection.
.TP
.B CFM_NO_METRICS
Set to "1" to disable code metrics.
.\"
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/cfm/config.toml
Configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/cfm/cfmd.sock
Daemon socket file.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/cfm/banner_cache.json
Cached banner data.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/cfm/dir_sizes.json
Cached directory sizes.
.\"
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Error occurred.
.\"
